=== 2) the bugs the 24.04 script WOULD hit, executed on 25.04 directly ===

--- N1: libcanberra-gtk-module (line 68 of install-nghdl-24.04.sh):
$ apt-get install -y libcanberra-gtk-module libcanberra-gtk3-module
