  is only available from another source
  
  E: Package 'libcanberra-gtk-module' has no installation candidate

--- N2: unversioned llvm (line 55/58) resolves to LLVM 20 on 25.04:
$ apt-cache policy llvm | grep Candidate
    Candidate: 1:20.0-63ubuntu1
  (GHDL 4.1.0 cannot use LLVM >= 19 - ghdl/ghdl#2711)

--- N3: configure line (105) points at the system default llvm-config:
  ./configure --with-llvm-config=/usr/bin/llvm-config
  /usr/bin/llvm-config -> LLVM 20.1.2

--- N4: uninstall purge line (305) with llvm_version undefined:
  apt-get purge -y llvm-${llvm_version} llvm-${llvm_version}-dev
  expands to: apt-get purge -y llvm- llvm--dev   (empty package names)

